<\/em> peer-review journal editorial team<\/p>\r\n<p>\u0420\u0435\u0434\u0430\u043a\u0446\u0438\u044f \u0436\u0443\u0440\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0430 <em>\u041c\u043e\u0440\u0444\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u044f&nbsp;<\/em><\/p>\r\n<p>E-mail: <a href=\"mailto:morphology-spb-msk@eco-vector.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">morphology-spb-msk@eco-vector.<wbr>com<\/a><br>Phone: +7 (926) 204-83-26<br>WEB: <a href=\"https:\/\/j-morphology.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/j-morphology.com\/<\/a>&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n<p>ISSN: 1026-3543 (Print)<br>ISSN: 2949-2556 (Online)<\/p>","enableAnnouncements":false,"enableAnnouncementsHomepage":false,"enableComments":0,"enableLockss":true,"enablePageNumber":true,"enablePrePrints":true,"enablePublicArticleId":true,"enablePublicGalleyId":true,"enablePublicIssueId":true,"enablePublicSuppFileId":true,"envelopeSender":"morphology-spb-msk@eco-vector.com","fastTrackFeeDescription":{"ru_RU":"<p>##default.journalSettings.fastTrackFeeDescription##<\/p>"},"fastTrackFeeEnabled":false,"fastTrackFeeName":{"ru_RU":"##default.journalSettings.fastTrackFee##"},"history":{"en_US":"<p>The journal has changed several titles<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">From 1916 to 1930&nbsp; \u2014 Russkii\u0306 arkhiv anatomii, gistologii i embriologii<br>(<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/72433\">https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/72433<\/a>)<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">From 1931 to 1991 \u0433\u043e\u0434 \u2014 Arkhiv anatomii, gistologii i e\u0301mbriologii ISSN 0004-1947<br>(<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/370603\">https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/370603<\/a>)<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">From 1992 to present - Morphology ISSN 1026-3543<br>(<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/9317610\">https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/9317610<\/a>)<\/p>","ru_RU":"<p>\u0416\u0443\u0440\u043d\u0430\u043b \u0432\u044b\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0438\u043b \u043f\u043e\u0434 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043d\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0437\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f\u043c\u0438 \u0432 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f:&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\u0421 1916 \u043f\u043e 1930 \u0433\u043e\u0434 \u2014 \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 \u0430\u0440\u0445\u0438\u0432 \u0430\u043d\u0430\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0438\u0438, \u0433\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0438 \u0438 \u044d\u043c\u0431\u0440\u0438\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0438 <br>(<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/72433\">https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/72433<\/a>)<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\u0421 1931 \u043f\u043e 1991 \u0433\u043e\u0434 \u2014 \u0410\u0440\u0445\u0438\u0432 \u0430\u043d\u0430\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0438\u0438, \u0433\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0438 \u0438 \u044d\u043c\u0431\u0440\u0438\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0438 ISSN 0004-1947<br>(<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/370603\">https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/370603<\/a>)<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">\u0421 1992 \u0434\u043e \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u0449\u0435\u0433\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438 - \u041c\u043e\u0440\u0444\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u044f ISSN 1026-3543<br>(<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/9317610\">https:\/\/www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/nlmcatalog\/9317610<\/a>)<\/p>"},"homeChiefEditorUrl":"","homeHeaderTitle":{"en_US":"Morphology","ru_RU":"\u041c\u043e\u0440\u0444\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u044f"},"homepageImage":{"en_US":{"name":"\u041c\u043e\u0440\u0444\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u044f_\u043e\u0431\u043b\u043e\u0436\u043a\u0430.jpg","uploadName":"homepageImage_en_US.jpg","width":567,"height":821,"mimeType":"image\/jpeg","dateUploaded":"2023-07-24 13:31:32"},"ru_RU":{"name":"\u041c\u043e\u0440\u0444\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u04